      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Jiri Pirko",
      "date": "2026-07-14T14:29:27",
      "summary": "该补丁为 RDMA 子系统添加了一个 kselftest 脚本（rxe_netns_names.sh），用于测试 RXE（软件 RDMA 驱动）在不同网络命名空间下的设备命名行为。测试覆盖跨命名空间的重复名称检测、移动冲突处理、移动并改名、以及同命名空间内的改名请求等场景。该改动涉及 netns 中 RDMA 设备的命名与重命名逻辑验证，依赖 CONFIG_DUMMY、CONFIG_NET_NS、CONFIG_RDMA_RXE 等配置，属于容器网络场景下的 RDMA 设备管理测试。",
      "tags": [
        "容器网络",
        "驱动",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "medium",
      "readingTime": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 14686701,
      "title": "[rdma-next,v2,08/14] RDMA/cgroup: Disambiguate devices across net namespaces",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260714142927.1298897-9-jiri@resnulli.us",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714142927.1298897-9-jiri@resnulli.us/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714142927.1298897-9-jiri@resnulli.us/mbox/",
      "hash": "9b60df775b26e35b504b9d05654ea981b3c8f481",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Jiri Pirko",
      "date": "2026-07-14T14:29:21",
      "summary": "该补丁修改 RDMA cgroup 控制器，解决跨网络命名空间的设备命名歧义问题。由于 RDMA 设备名仅在同一 netns 内唯一，当 cgroup 需要统计来自多个 netns 的设备资源时，重复名称会导致 cgroup 输出和 limit 写入产生歧义。补丁引入系统级 RDMA 设备索引（index=N）来区分重名设备，保留唯一名称的原有 UAPI；对歧义名称的纯名称写入返回 -ENOTUNIQ，管理员可通过索引获取完整设备视图。同时更新了 cgroup-v1/rdma.rst 和 cgroup-v2.rst 文档说明新格式。",
      "tags": [
        "Linux内核网络",
        "虚拟化",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "medium",
      "readingTime": 5
    },
    {
      "id": 14686631,
      "title": "[v3,net,2/6] xsk: drain continuation descs after overflow in xsk_build_skb()",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260714140722.111645-3-maciej.fijalkowski@intel.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714140722.111645-3-maciej.fijalkowski@intel.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714140722.111645-3-maciej.fijalkowski@intel.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "86807bb7232c670bfe79b79da69f2b4c04ebcde4",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Maciej Fijalkowski",
      "date": "2026-07-14T14:07:18",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 AF_XDP 通用 Xmit 路径中多缓冲区（multi-buffer）Tx 逻辑的缺陷。当 xsk_build_skb() 构建 SKB 时遇到描述符数量超过 MAX_SKB_FRAGS 或包含无效描述符的情况，后续的 continuation 描述符会丢失且无法再次访问。补丁在 xdp_sock 结构中新增 drain_cont 标志位，当该标志置位时持续消费 AF_XDP Tx 环上剩余的描述符并直接放入完成队列（CQ），同时将 cq 地址提交逻辑封装为独立函数 xsk_cq_submit_addr_single_locked。该修复解决了描述符泄漏问题，确保 Tx 环与 CQ 之间描述符流转的正确性，避免因描述符丢失导致的卡死或资源不一致。",
      "tags": [
        "XDP",
        "eBPF",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 6
    },
    {
      "id": 14686630,
      "title": "[v3,net,1/6] xsk: fix buffer leak in xsk_drop_skb() for AF_XDP multi-buffer Tx",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260714140722.111645-2-maciej.fijalkowski@intel.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714140722.111645-2-maciej.fijalkowski@intel.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714140722.111645-2-maciej.fijalkowski@intel.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "925ed292f0afa959ac2518f8e237e3213ec7bc24",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Maciej Fijalkowski",
      "date": "2026-07-14T14:07:17",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 AF_XDP 多缓冲区 Tx 路径中 `xsk_drop_skb()` 导致的缓冲区泄漏问题。当部分构建的多缓冲 skb 被丢弃（-EOVERFLOW、无效描述符或 socket 关闭场景）时，原代码调用 `xsk_consume_skb()` 取消了 CQ 预留槽位（xsk_cq_cancel_locked），导致缓冲区地址永远不会出现在完成队列中，用户态永久丢失这些缓冲区。修复方案是将 `xsk_consume_skb()` 替换为 `consume_skb()`，触发已有的 `xsk_destruct_skb` 析构函数，通过 `xsk_cq_submit_addr_locked()` 将缓冲区地址正确提交到 CQ；同时额外将描述符地址存入 `xsk_addr->addrs` 数组并在 drop 后将 `xs->skb` 置空，避免悬挂引用。",
      "tags": [
        "XDP",
        "eBPF",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 14686306,
      "title": "[net] ipv4: require matching source address for route hint reuse",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260714122618.21698-1-zhaoyz24@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714122618.21698-1-zhaoyz24@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714122618.21698-1-zhaoyz24@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn/mbox/",
      "hash": "9dac5a6e041940a45a06ad2c2dbe1863c019cccf",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Yizhou Zhao",
      "date": "2026-07-14T12:26:17",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 IPv4 列表接收（ip_list_rcv）中路由提示（route hint）复用逻辑的安全缺陷。原逻辑在 ip_can_use_hint() 中仅比较目的地址和 TOS，对于转发路由 ip_route_use_hint() 会跳过 fib_validate_source()，导致不同源地址的数据包可复用前一个数据包的转发 dst，从而绕过 ingress 网卡的 strict rp_filter 等源地址校验。补丁增加对源地址（saddr）匹配的检查，只有同源/同目的/同 TOS 的包才走快速路径，不同源的包则走正常路由查找与校验流程，从而在保持性能优化的同时恢复正确的源地址验证。",
      "tags": [
        "TCP/IP",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 14686106,
      "title": "[net,v2] ila: reload IPv6 header after pskb_may_pull in checksum adjust",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260714114903.3763420-1-michael.bommarito@gmail.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714114903.3763420-1-michael.bommarito@gmail.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714114903.3763420-1-michael.bommarito@gmail.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "af304a5671969848e8cdf98451c67e06d92309e7",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Michael Bommarito",
      "date": "2026-07-14T11:49:03",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 ILA（Identifier-Locator Addressing，IPv6 标识符-定位符寻址）模块中的一个 use-after-free 漏洞。`ila_csum_adjust_transport()` 在调用 `pskb_may_pull()` 之前缓存了 `ip6h = ipv6_hdr(skb)` 指针，但对于非线性的 skb，`pskb_may_pull()` 可能通过 `__pskb_pull_tail()` / `pskb_expand_head()` 释放旧的 skb head，导致后续 `get_csum_diff(ip6h, p)` 及 `ila_update_ipv6_locator()` 写操作访问已释放内存（KASAN 报告 slab-use-after-free）。修复方案是：TCP/UDP/ICMP6 分支在 `pskb_may_pull()` 之后重新获取 `ip6h`；`ila_update_ipv6_locator()` 仅在 ILA_CSUM_ADJUST_TRANSPORT 路径下重新加载 `ip6h` 与 `iaddr`，neutral-map 模式不 pull 故保持原缓存指针。该漏洞需要 CAP_NET_ADMIN 配置触发路由，但触发包未认证即可触发。",
      "tags": [
        "TCP/IP",
        "包处理",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 14685598,
      "title": "[net-next] ppp: reuse ppp_get_stats64() for ioctl stats",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260714091941.33783-1-running910@gmail.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714091941.33783-1-running910@gmail.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260714091941.33783-1-running910@gmail.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "4e0b47f4e0cced1ff9cac381c3daf9adde98fc66",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Zhixing Chen",
      "date": "2026-07-14T09:19:41",
      "summary": "该补丁针对 PPP 通用驱动（drivers/net/ppp/ppp_generic.c）进行代码清理。原有的 ppp_get_stats() 在为遗留 SIOCGPPPSTATS ioctl 路径填充 struct ppp_stats 时，手动通过 for_each_possible_cpu 遍历每 CPU 的 pcpu_sw_netstats 来聚合收发包和字节计数，与 ppp_get_stats64() 的逻辑重复。补丁改为直接调用 ppp_get_stats64() 获取 rtnl_link_stats64，再将 rx/tx_packets 和 rx/tx_bytes 赋值给 st->p 的对应字段，错误计数也从 dev->stats 统一读取。这消除了 ioctl 路径中重复的 per-CPU 聚合代码，使两条统计路径行为一致，属于纯粹的代码重构，无功能性变更。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 14685480,
      "title": "net: core: use WARN_ON_ONCE in datagram iterators",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260714082511.2817-1-igorpetindev@gmail.com",
