      "id": 14679165,
      "title": "[bpf-next] bpf: Fix unused nskb warning in bpf_icmp_send",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260710180915.7105-1-mahe.tardy@gmail.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260710180915.7105-1-mahe.tardy@gmail.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260710180915.7105-1-mahe.tardy@gmail.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "ac311a5e493f226bcef2cf7f18d370ff75a508d1",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Mahe Tardy",
      "date": "2026-07-10T18:09:15",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 BPF kfunc `bpf_icmp_send` 中 `nskb` 变量的未使用告警。原代码在函数顶部声明 `nskb`，但仅在 IPv4 和 IPv6 的 switch case 分支中使用。补丁将变量声明移入各自 case 块的作用域内（用大括号包裹），使其仅在对应代码路径下可见，从而消除编译器告警。该修改属于代码清理类修复，不影响运行逻辑，但提升了不同编译配置（如 CONFIG_INET/CONFIG_IPV6 单独禁用）下的构建清洁度。",
      "tags": [
        "eBPF",
        "TCP/IP",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 14678106,
      "title": "[08/10] xfrm: iptfs: propagate SKBFL_SHARED_FRAG in iptfs_skb_add_frags()",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260710090349.343389-9-steffen.klassert@secunet.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260710090349.343389-9-steffen.klassert@secunet.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260710090349.343389-9-steffen.klassert@secunet.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "15c1c1215613f30743d58268883f29a6c7886298",
      "commitRef": "430ea57d6daf765e88f90046afbfd1e071cb7200",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Steffen Klassert",
      "date": "2026-07-10T09:03:21",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 xfrm IPTFS 中 iptfs_skb_add_frags() 函数未正确传播 SKBFL_SHARED_FRAG 标志的问题。当从源 SKB 复制 frag 引用到新 SKB 时，仅增加了页面引用计数但未设置共享标志，导致后续嵌套传输模式 SA 的 esp_input() 走 no-COW 快速路径原地解密，覆盖仍被外层 IPTFS SKB 引用的页面，从而引发内存损坏甚至内核 panic。补丁在 __skb_frag_ref() 和 nr_frags++ 后无条件设置 SKBFL_SHARED_FRAG，与 skb_segment、skb_gro_receive 等其他 frag 传输辅助函数保持一致。",
      "tags": [
        "TCP/IP",
        "Linux内核网络",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14678112,
      "title": "[03/10] xfrm: nat_keepalive: avoid double free on send error",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260710090349.343389-4-steffen.klassert@secunet.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260710090349.343389-4-steffen.klassert@secunet.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260710090349.343389-4-steffen.klassert@secunet.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "baf4576f79dcd78a5ae7d3cf2dcc8da3c72f4512",
      "commitRef": "226f4a490d1a938fc838d8f8c46a4eca864c0d78",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Steffen Klassert",
      "date": "2026-07-10T09:03:16",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 XFRM（IPsec）子系统中 NAT keepalive 功能的双重释放（double free）缺陷。原代码在 `nat_keepalive_send()` 派发函数中错误地对发送失败的 skb 调用 `kfree_skb()`，但一旦 skb 被 `ip_build_and_send_pkt()` 或 `ip6_xmit()` 接管后，网络栈可能已消费该 skb，再次释放会导致内存安全问题。修复方案是将 skb 释放逻辑下沉到 `nat_keepalive_send_ipv4()` 和 `nat_keepalive_send_ipv6()` 中，仅在调用方仍持有 skb 所有权时（路由查找失败等 pre-handoff 阶段）释放；派发函数只负责协议族路由和 unsupported-family 的清理。",
      "tags": [
        "TCP/IP",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14678105,
      "title": "[01/10] xfrm: propagate -EINPROGRESS from validate_xmit_xfrm()",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260710090349.343389-2-steffen.klassert@secunet.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260710090349.343389-2-steffen.klassert@secunet.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260710090349.343389-2-steffen.klassert@secunet.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "8129b79cc79de9b7bceca10c3bb875ace81075db",
      "commitRef": "6860b467f569f732b11cbc588ae7e195e90e7e23",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Steffen Klassert",
      "date": "2026-07-10T09:03:14",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 XFRM（IPsec）异步加密场景下网络设备发送路径的错误返回问题。`validate_xmit_xfrm()` 此前对\"报文被丢弃\"和\"报文被异步加密窃取（-EINPROGRESS）\"两种情况都返回 NULL，导致 `__dev_queue_xmit()` 无法区分，在虚拟/网桥接口上错误地向调用者返回 -ENOMEM。修复方案是让 `validate_xmit_xfrm()` 在异步场景下返回 `ERR_PTR(-EINPROGRESS)`，更新 `__dev_queue_xmit()` 检测该错误指针并返回 `NET_XMIT_SUCCESS`，同时用 `IS_ERR_OR_NULL()` 保护 `validate_xmit_skb_list()` 避免将正在异步处理的报文误加入已发送列表。该修改正确处理了异步 IPsec offload 的语义，避免了上层协议收到错误的返回值。",
      "tags": [
        "TCP/IP",
        "包处理",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 14676481,
