      "hash": "f2a0ad5882de3c1850bd6f1f56e433503a7ba63f",
      "commitRef": "63a704c8b3699eeb80ae2684da60d56081ae79b4",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Admin",
      "date": "2026-07-09T18:27:59",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 bpf_cpumask_populate() kfunc 的验证器安全问题。原实现将目标参数声明为 struct cpumask *，导致 BPF 验证器接受来自只读 kfunc（如 scx_bpf_get_online_cpumask()）返回的借用 cpumask 指针作为可写目标，违反了所有权规则。补丁将目标类型改为 struct bpf_cpumask *，与其它可变 cpumask kfunc 保持一致的拥有权语义，确保只有真正可写入的 BPF cpumask 对象才能被 populate。查询类 kfunc 仍接受 const struct cpumask * 输入，行为不变。",
      "tags": [
        "eBPF",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
